lic>Podocoryne carnea</italic>: 976094; 6118056; 6465862; 7649930; 9964019; 47155914; 62002543; <italic>Sarsia sp</italic>.: 9988771; <italic>Scolionema suvaense</italic>: 158936914; <italic>Suberites domuncula</italic>: 49659005; <italic>Trichoplax adhaerens</italic>: 38565482</p></sec></sec></body><back><sec><title>Acknowledgements</title><p>NAF is the recipient of a Post-Doctoral grant SFRH/BPD/26737/2006 from FCT. This work has been partially funded by POCI 2010, co-funded by FEDER funds.</p></sec><ref-list><ref id="B1"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><name><surname>B&#x000fc;rglin</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><person-group person-group-type="editor">Duboule D</person-group><article-title>A comprehensive classification of homeobox genes</article-title><source>Guidebook to the Homeobox Genes</source><year>1994</year><publisher-name>Oxford , Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>25</fpage><lpage>71</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B2"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><name><surname>B&#x000fc;rglin</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><person-group person-group-type="editor">Meyers RA</person-group><article-title>Homeodomain proteins</article-title><source>Encyclopedia of Molecular Cell Biology and Molecular Medicine</source><year>2005</year><volume>6</volume><edition>2</edition><publisher-name>Weinheim , Wiley-VCH Verlag GmbH &#x00026; Co.</publisher-name><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>222</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B3"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Slack</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Holland</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Graham</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><article-title>The zootype and the phylotypic stage</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1993</year><volume>361</volume><issue>6412</issue><fpage>490</fpage><lpage>492</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8094230</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><r